    <div class="story-copy">
      <p class="section-index">The short story</p>
      <h2>I learned to build by working inside real businesses.</h2>
      <p>I founded Upstack Studio in 2017 and spent years helping owners turn business problems into web and mobile software. It taught me that the hard part is rarely the code. It is understanding the business well enough to make the right decision.</p>
      <p>Eventually, I closed the agency rather than keep optimizing a model I no longer wanted to build. AI had changed the economics of software—and I wanted to become an owner of products, not only a builder for other people.</p>
      <p>Today, I’m building Second Team, developing a long-term maker portfolio and sharing the lessons while they are still fresh.</p>
      <a class="button button-outline" href="/about/">Read my full story</a>
    </div>
